=2 Walkthrough
The goal of this assault is to guide 1 or more NPC {n:Qiqirn Divers|Qiqirn Diver} from the start point at (F-10) to the {n:Qiqirn Chief Diver} at (J-6)
* Talking to a Qiqirn Diver will induce it to follow you.
* A single player can lead multiple Qiqirn Divers simultaneously.
* NPCs named {n:Giant Orobons|Giant Orobon} patrol the map looking for tasty Qiqirns to eat.
** Don't let your Qiqirns get eaten.
* If an Orobon sees a Qiqirn, they will give chase and the Qiqirn will stop following the player and run away for a short time at enhanced speed.
* If your Qiqirns get scared off, click on them to induce them to follow you again.
* Bringing at least 1 Qiqirn Diver to the Chief Diver will spawn the {p:Rune of Release}.
** Bringing multiple Qiqirn Divers will result in a higher score, up to a maximum of 1166 points for all 5 Qiqirns escorted with 3 people.
*** 916 Points for bringing 3 Quqirn Divers with 3 or less participants.

